<title>CROATIA: Croatian Nov M1 shrinks 0.2 pct, M4 rises 1.6 pct. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Croatian Nov M1 shrinks 0.2 pct, M4 rises 1.6 pct. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MONEY SUPPLY	   NOV '96     OCT '96     NOV '95</p>
<p> Reserve money (million HRK)  7,876.2     7,962.9     6,549.8</p>
<p> M1 money supply		 10,590.8    10,611.8     8,199.2</p>
<p>(Corrects Nov '95 M1 money supply figure to 8,199.2 from 23,734.4)</p>
<p> Broadest money M4	     34,910.9    34,360.6    23,734.4</p>
<p>NOTE -- November reserve money shrank 1.09 percent from October and M1 money supply 0.20 percent. Broadest money M4 or total liquid assets increased 1.6 percent on a monthly level. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
